== [1] Design of record: the bottom tab bar HIDES in a channel on phone, stays on tablet

Page: "Bottom Tab Bar" — space Mobile v2 Design (MSU) — public:
  https://mattermost.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MSU/pages/1508376633/Bottom+Tab+Bar
Section "Hiding the Bottom Tab Bar in Channels" (>h2 data-renderer-start-pos="1607"), verbatim:

  "Once a user is within a channel, the bottom tab bar slides off the bottom to save room for the
   channel content and the Message Input component. For Tablets, however, the bottom tab remains at
   all times since channels are in view at the same time as the sidebar."

-- read from the page's rendered HTML (the text also appears in the page's ADF JSON payload); the
-- page title element reads "Bottom Tab Bar - Mobile v2 Design - Confluence".


